.nh
.TH "glab" "1" "Sep 2026" "Auto generated by spf13/cobra" ""

.SH "نام (NAME)"
glab-mr-diff \- View changes in a merge request.


.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBglab mr diff [ | ] [flags]\fP


.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Defaults to the currently checked-out branch. Use \fB--color=never\fR
to disable color output.


.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
\fB--color\fP="auto"
	Use color in diff output: always, never, auto.

.PP
\fB--raw\fP[=false]
	Use raw diff format that can be piped to commands.


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	Show help for this command.

.PP
\fB-R\fP, \fB--repo\fP=""
	Select another repository. You can use either OWNER/REPO or GROUP/NAMESPACE/REPO. The full URL or Git URL is also accepted.


.SH "مثال (EXAMPLE)"
.EX
glab mr diff 123
glab mr diff branch

# Get merge request from current branch
glab mr diff

glab mr diff 123 --color=never
.EE


.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBglab-mr(1)\fP
